<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n81985" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περίπολος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περιπέλομαι</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>going the rounds, patrolling</i>: hence, as
				Subst., </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>1.</b>
			<i>watchman, patrol</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Epich.
				35.10
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Num.</u>
				16
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>VH</u>
				2.6
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. τῶν βασιλείων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lib.
					<u>Or.</u>
					59.144
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> pl., at
			Athens, <i>patrol</i>, in which <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔφηβοι</span> (and also non-Athenians, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Lys.
				13.71
			</span></i> with <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				8.92
			</span></i>) served, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Av.</u>
				1177
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				4.67
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				8.92
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοὺς π. ἀπιέν᾽ εἰς τὰ φρούρια</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Eup.
					341
				</span></i>
			 : sg. in <i><span class="en">
				Aeschin.
				2.167
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> generally,
				<i>attendant, follower</i>, as fem., <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Ant.</u>
				1150
			</span></i> (lyr.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. πάσης τῆς ὑφ᾽ ἥλιον</span>
				'<i>globe-trotter</i>', <i><span class="en">
				Him.
				<u>Or.</u>
				14.25
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Lib.
				<u>Ep.</u>
				168
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>5.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περίπολος</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ναῦς</span>), ἡ,
				<i>guardship</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arr.
				<u>An.</u>
				2.20.2
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
